 const formModal=<Dialog open={modal==='form'} onOpenChange={v=>{if(!v)setModal('')}}><DialogContent style={{maxWidth:modal==='products'?960:modal==='knowledge'||modal==='materials'?680:undefined}}><DialogTitle>{formGoal} · 演示表单</DialogTitle><DialogDescription>提交仅演示交互，不发送或保存至业务系统。</DialogDescription>{formDone?<div className="success-box"><CheckCircle2/><h3>演示提交完成</h3><p>该记录不会进入真实线索统计。</p><Button onClick={()=>setModal('')}>返回页面</Button></div>:<form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();setFormDone(true)}} className="dialog-fields">{inferredFields.map(field=><label key={field}>{field}<Input required type={field==='邮箱'?'email':field==='预约日期'?'date':field==='电话'?'tel':'text'} name={field} placeholder={`请输入${field}`}/></label>)}<label className="checkline"><input type="checkbox" required/>我已了解本表单仅用于交互演示</label><Button type="submit">提交演示</Button></form>}</DialogContent></Dialog>
